                                "sense_id": "c9c512af-f976-3874-ad2f-3b9207ee460f",
                                "text": "Hydrargyrum, Quick-ſilver, a Mineral, of a ſtrange piercing Quality, ſo as to eat thro' Gold, Silver, &c."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b3015d38-c263-418d-a5e5-fa6eb6ad51ac",
                                "sense_id": "c9c512af-f976-3874-ad2f-3b9207ee460f",
                                "text": "‘There is a channel in the spine of her blade, and in it runs a river of hydrargyrum—a metal heavier than iron, though it flows like water.’"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
